in two pairs, I should play the weaker pair first to maintain control. The 8s are less likely to be beaten than if I play singles, and if they hold, I can finish immediately with Kings next turn. Playing Kings first would waste my strongest combination when the 8s might be sufficient.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥8", "♣8"]}'}
